    "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2020 the Syndicate carried gross claims outstanding of GBP 261.259m at the opening of the year (prior year). During 2020 there was a net gross prioryear strengthening of approximately GBP 22.19m (8.5% of opening gross reserves). This net movement reflects a material provision being established for 2018 pure business (+GBP 30.894m gross) partly offset by a release on 2017 and earlier years (GBP 8.704m gross) attributed in the report to favourable claims development in 2020. The report cites specific natural catastrophe activity (Hurricanes Florence and Michael and west coast wildfires) and COVID19 pandemic effects as material drivers of losses in the period, and highlights that a large part of the pandemic estimate is IBNR.",
